<title>SWEDEN: Electrolux lifts Refripar stake.</title>
<headline>Electrolux lifts Refripar stake.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish appliance maker Electrolux on Monday said it had increased its ownership in Brazil's Refripar to 50 percent of capital and 99 percent of voting shares.</p>
<p>Electrolux said an extraordinary meeting of the Brazilian white-goods company on November 29 approved the purchase through its two wholly owned Brazilian subsidiaries, Electrolux LTDA and Oberdorfer SA.  </p>
<p>Previously, Electrolux held 35 percent of Refripar's equity and 98 percent of its voting shares, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001006</p>
</text>
